content='<think>\nOkay, I need to fix the Ansible Playbook so that it passes ansible-lint. Let me look at the error messages to understand what\'s wrong.\n\nFirst, I see multiple issues about forbidden implicit octal values, specifically the "0640" mode. Ansible-lint doesn\'t like implicit octal numbers. So, I should convert these to decimal or use quotes to make them explicit. But since YAML doesn\'t allow implicit octals, the correct way is to use quotes around the numbers to make them strings, which Ansible will interpret correctly.\n\nNext, there\'s an error in the PKCS#12 task about unsupported parameters: cert_path and key_path. The error message suggests that these parameters aren\'t supported for the module used. I should check the correct parameters for the community.crypto.openssl_pkcs12 module. It looks like the correct parameters are privatekey_path and certificate_path instead of key_path and cert_path. So I\'ll need to adjust those.\n\nLet me go through each task:\n\n1. **Create an SSL private key**: The mode is 0640. I\'ll change it to mode: \'0640\' to make it a string.\n\n2. **Create an SSL CSR**: Same issue with 0640. Change to mode: \'0640\'.\n\n3. **Create SSL certificates**: Again, 0640. Change to mode: \'0640\'.\n\n4. **Create a PKCS#12 file**: Here, the module is using cert_path and key_path, which are incorrect. I\'ll replace them with certificate_path and privatekey_path. Also, add mode: \'0640\' here as well.\n\n5. **Read the private key and certificate**: These tasks don\'t have any issues with octal values, so they\'re fine.\n\n6. **Create a combined file**: This task also uses 0640, so I\'ll change it to mode: \'0640\'.\n\nI\'ll make sure all the mode values are quoted to convert them to strings, which should fix the implicit octal errors. Also, I\'ll correct the parameters in the PKCS#12 task to use the right keys.\n\nNow, I\'ll reconstruct the playbook with these changes, ensuring that only the necessary fixes are made without altering the task order or functionality.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Create an SSL private key\n  community.crypto.openssl_privatekey:\n    path: /etc/ssl/private/nginxPrivateKey\n    type: RSA\n    size: 4096\n    mode: \'0640\'\n    owner: www-data\n    group: www-data\n\n- name: Create an SSL Certificate Signing Request (CSR)\n  community.crypto.openssl_csr:\n    path: /etc/ssl/certs/nginxCsr\n    privatekey_path: /etc/ssl/private/nginxPrivateKey\n    common_name: example.com\n    mode: \'0640\'\n    owner: www-data\n    group: www-data\n\n- name: Create SSL certificates\n  community.crypto.x509_certificate:\n    path: /etc/ssl/certs/nginxCertificate\n    provider: selfsigned\n    csr_path: /etc/ssl/certs/nginxCsr\n    mode: \'0640\'\n    owner: www-data\n    group: www-data\n\n- name: Create a PKCS#12 file\n  community.crypto.openssl_pkcs12:\n    path: /etc/ssl/nginx.pfx\n    name: Nginx Server Cert\n    privatekey_path: /etc/ssl/private/nginxPrivateKey\n    certificate_path: /etc/ssl/certs/nginxCertificate\n    mode: \'0640\'\n    owner: www-data\n    group: www-data\n\n- name: Read the private key\n  ansible.builtin.slurp:\n    src: /etc/ssl/private/nginxPrivateKey\n  register: private_key\n\n- name: Read the certificate\n  ansible.builtin.slurp:\n    src: /etc/ssl/certs/nginxCertificate\n  register: certificate\n\n- name: Create a combined private key and certificate file\n  ansible.builtin.copy:\n    content: |\n      {{ (private_key.content).decode(\'utf-8\') }}\n      {{ (certificate.content).decode(\'utf-8\') }}\n    dest: /etc/ssl/nginx.keyandcert\n    mode: \'0640\'\n    owner: www-data\n    group: www-data\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-23T16:37:34.976429651Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 22908426055, 'load_duration': 88241684, 'prompt_eval_count': 2445, 'prompt_eval_duration': 1243950529, 'eval_count': 944, 'eval_duration': 21574777165, 'model_name': 'deepseek